  "idea": "Focus time blocking tool that syncs Slack status and disables notifications",
  "text": "Here is how remote developers protect four hours of uninterrupted deep work every day. Fragmented thirty-minute syncs constantly wreck your morning, leaving zero energy for complex engineering tasks. Every unscheduled Slack notification breaks momentum, costing twenty-three minutes just to rebuild cognitive focus. Reclaim automatically schedules dynamic focus blocks on Google Calendar while switching your Slack status to offline. This lets you finish sprint deliverables without working late nights.",
